{{!
    @template tool_lp/evidence_summary

    One piece of evidence of a user competency, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/evidence_summary of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500), admin/tool/lp/templates/evidence_summary.mustache.
    Re-diff it against that file on every core upgrade.

    Kept from core, because tool_lp/evidence_delete reads them: the container's
    data-region="evidence" and data-id (the delete handler refuses unless exactly one ancestor carries
    that region, so no element inside may carry it again), the trigger's data-action="delete-evidence",
    and the JavaScript registering the two selectors. Kept for Behat: the rating is a span with the
    class badge (tool_lp's "competency grade" selector). Every context key keeps core's escaping
    (all double-stashed: the description and the note are plain text from the exporter).
    Changed: the evidence is a card (dim-comp-evidence) with the person, the date and the delete action
    on one line; the date is a span, because core's time element carried the formatted date as its
    datetime attribute, which is no machine-readable date (the HTML validator refuses it); the rating
    is a rated pill with an icon; the delete icon carries the "Delete" string as its accessible name,
    where core's had none; the note is a styled quote.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id - the evidence id
    * actionuser - a user_summary_exporter record, or nothing
    * userdate - the formatted date of the evidence
    * grade, gradename - the rating it carried, if any
    * description - what happened
    * note - an optional note
    * url - an optional link
    * candelete - boolean

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 1,
        "actionuser": {
            "id": 2,
            "fullname": "Tess Teacher",
            "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/profile.php?id=2",
            "profileimageurlsmall": "https://example.com/pix/u/f2.png"
        },
        "userdate": "Tuesday, 13 October 2026, 10:04",
        "grade": 2,
        "gradename": "Met",
        "description": "The user competency was manually rated in the plan Personal plan A",
        "note": "Presented the case study to the group.",
        "url": "https://example.com/mod/assign/view.php?id=3",
        "candelete": true
    }
}}
<div class="dim-comp-evidence evidence" data-region="evidence" data-id="{{id}}">
    <div class="dim-comp-evidence__head">
        {{#actionuser}}
            {{> tool_lp/user_summary }}
        {{/actionuser}}
        <span class="dim-comp-evidence__time">{{userdate}}</span>
        {{#candelete}}
        <span class="dim-comp-evidence__actions">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-link btn-sm" data-action="delete-evidence">{{#pix}}t/delete, core, {{#str}}delete{{/str}}{{/pix}}</a>
        </span>
        {{/candelete}}
    </div>
    {{#grade}}
    <p class="dim-comp-pills">
        <span class="badge dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--rated">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            {{gradename}}
        </span>
    </p>
    {{/grade}}
    <p class="dim-comp-evidence__description">{{description}}</p>
    {{#note}}
    <blockquote class="dim-comp-evidence__note">{{note}}</blockquote>
    {{/note}}
    {{#url}}
    <p class="dim-comp-evidence__url"><a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{{url}}</a></p>
    {{/url}}
</div>

{{#js}}
require(['tool_lp/evidence_delete'], function(EvidenceDelete) {
    EvidenceDelete.register('[data-action="delete-evidence"]', '[data-region="evidence"]');
});
{{/js}}
